The "Discount Rate" is 80%.

This Safe is one of a series of Safes referred to as the "2024 Series Seed Safes." Standard YC provisions for conversion, equity financing, liquidity event, dissolution event, and standard provisions of definitions apply.

Standard provisions for amendments, governing law, dispute resolution, counterparts, and other miscellaneous matters apply.
